            "answer": {
              "short": "$-0.35$",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_{10}\\frac1{\\sqrt5}&=-\\tfrac12\\log_{10}5\\\\\\log_{10}\\frac1{\\sqrt5}&\\approx-\\tfrac12(0.70)\\\\\\log_{10}\\frac1{\\sqrt5}&\\approx-0.35\\end{align*}$$",
